# --- Per-participant / individual-level outputs -----------------------------
# Derived from real human-subject data; excluded from the public repo.
# Aggregate/cohort-level paper figures (fig2-fig5, selection_overlap,
# algorithm_flowchart, fig_bootstrap_retest) are tracked as-is.
# fig1_example_curve is EXCLUDED: it plots one real participant's raw
# curve and labels the panel with their actual study ID (see figures.py,
# figure1_example_curve -> ax1.set_title(f"... {pid} {side} {freq} Hz")).
outputs/curve_fits/
outputs/fig1_example_curve.*
outputs/experiment_results.csv
outputs/reference_results.csv
outputs/sample_analysis.csv
outputs/bootstrap_retest_results.csv
